<PageLayout
  title="Topical tanning: the real science of a tan in a cream"
  kicker="Pigment on demand"
  description="The dream of a lotion that tans you without the sun splits cleanly in two: fake tans that stain dead skin, and genuine topical pigment-switches that make your own melanin. Here's what actually works, what's still in the lab, and why the skin barrier is the whole game — explained plainly and cited."
